<title>USA: PairGain says shareholders okay split.</title>
<headline>PairGain says shareholders okay split.</headline>
<dateline>TUSTIN, Calif. 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PairGain Technologies Inc said its stockholders and its board of directors have approved the company's previously announced two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The split is payable in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend on December 18 to shareholders of record on December 11.</p>
